WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.500
In a laboratory, a Unitree G1 humanoid steps forward on a padded incline, bends, and lowers a handheld tool toward the pad.

00:06.500 --> 00:11.800
In a separate trial, the G1 bends deeply, bringing its hand and tool close to the padded surface.

00:11.800 --> 00:16.800
On an unfinished pitched roof, a worker carries a sheet of sheathing across the slope.

00:16.800 --> 00:21.800
The worker bends over the sheathing and works close to the surface with a handheld tool.

00:21.800 --> 00:26.800
The worker lowers into a deep crouch, feet on the slope, and keeps working near the surface.
